/* ===================== *
 *      Riftblade        *
 * ===================== */
@1101 = ~riftblade~
@1102 = ~Riftblade~
@1103 = ~Riftblade:

The Riftblade is a warrior who has mastered the manipulation of planar energies, drawing upon the forces that flow between worlds. The Riftblade can tear open brief passages through reality to cross distances in an instant, imbue <PRO_HISHER> weapons with dimensional power, and unleash rifts that banish enemies beyond the mortal plane. 
Their growing attunement to other worlds also grants <PRO_HIMHER> supernatural protection against creatures beyond the Material Plane.

Though the Riftblade wields extraordinary powers, <PRO_HESHE> remains a warrior first and foremost, relying on martial skill and mastery of dimensional forces rather than spellcasting.

Advantages:
- 1st level: May use Rift Step once per day, gaining an additional use at level 3 and every 3 levels thereafter.

Rift Step:
The Riftblade briefly tears open the fabric of space and steps through the resulting rift, instantly appearing at a selected location.

- 2nd level: May use Rift Strike once per day, gaining an additional use every 4 levels thereafter.

Rift Strike:
The Riftblade channels unstable dimensional energy into <PRO_HISHER> weapon, preparing a devastating strike that tears at the target's connection to reality.
The next successful melee attack deals additional magic damage. The target must save vs. Breath or suffer a dimensional disruption, reducing its movement speed for 2 rounds.
The damage and slow effect improve as the Riftblade gains experience:
- 2nd level: 1d8 magic damage, 20% movement speed reduction 
- 5th level: 2d8 magic damage, 30% movement speed reduction 
- 10th level: 3d8 magic damage, 40% movement speed reduction, save penalty increases to -2
- 15th level: 4d8 magic damage, 50% movement speed reduction
- 20th level: 5d8 magic damage, 60% movement speed reduction, save penalty increases to -4

- 4th level: Gains the Planar Ward passive ability.

Planar Ward:
The Riftblade's growing attunement to the planes grants <PRO_HIMHER> supernatural protection against creatures from other planes of existence. The Riftblade gains a +2 bonus to Armor Class and all saving throws when attacked by these creatures.
This protection expands as <PRO_HESHE> gains experience:
- Elemental Attunement (4th level): Elementals, Mephits, Salamandars and Genies
- Infernal Attunement (8th level): Imps and Demons
- Celestial Attunement (12th level): Planetars, Solars and Devas
- Astral Attunement (16th level): Githyanki

The protection from previously attained attunements is retained.

- 15th level: May use Mass Rift Strike once per day, gaining an additional use at level 20 and 25.

Mass Rift Strike:
The Riftblade unleashes a surge of dimensional energy, tearing at the fabric of reality around <PRO_HIMHER> and disrupting all nearby enemies.
All enemies within 30 feet suffer the current effects of Rift Strike.

- 18th level: Gains the Dimensional Anchor passive ability.

Dimensional Anchor:
The Riftblade binds <PRO_HISHER> essence to the material plane, resisting forces that would tear <PRO_HIMHER> away. The Riftblade is permanently immune to involuntary teleportation and dimensional displacement, Maze, and Imprisonment.

- High-Level Abilities: May learn the Rift Rend and Eternal Rift high level abilities.

Rift Rend:
The Riftblade delivers a devastating melee strike with <PRO_HISHER> next successful melee attack. Struck target is trapped in a dimensional labyrinth for several rounds as per the Maze spell.
This effect bypasses weapon protection spells such as Protection From Magical Weapons (requires EEex).

This ability may be selected up to 3 times.

Eternal Rift:
The Riftblade delivers a final strike with <PRO_HISHER> next successful melee attack. Struck target is permanetly trapped in an eternal prison beyond the boundaries of the material plane as per the Imprisonment spell.
This effect bypasses weapon protection spells such as Protection From Magical Weapons (requires EEex)

Requires: Rift Rend.

Disadvantages:
- d8 hit dice.
- May not learn the Power Attack, Critical Strike and Smite high level abilities.~

